    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/41015e1d55f48f4bc5a0d3ae30a4b112.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/e9c44cbfa7b8c6c3eddd6399e438a239.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span>Grey is an ordinary young man living in a rural town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the invitation of a fellow townsman, he traveled to the capital, Rivera, to participate in a months-long study exchange program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, on his very first night in Rivera, he had a strange dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dream, a group of people wearing eerie masks seemed to be plotting an assassination attempt on the king...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 The next day, news broke that the king was indeed attacked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should Grey use the information he had to help those who were innocently harmed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or should he stay out of trouble and keep his distance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly\u2014was what he saw that night truly just a dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/311a3575260de56d75721a4c613a81b0.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the fictional country of Merya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an era of booming industrial development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity is widespread, factory assembly lines roar around the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock codes scroll ceaselessly on towering billboards, and city center streets are packed with cars...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet no one notices that the glass-clad skyscrapers cast shadows large enough to engulf the entire city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/bf45fbd622ba1841fc8ac07e153a58cb.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/f389eb28ec24940174b3f8b977f4b135.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/00e3bf76ddfcdc6eb6c920fad18c8cd8.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/b0335e4cd064c653eefc82725ca3d33d.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=1600 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/fec024fb5e5fdce526e4af97ee1eae61.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Title</strong>: Halloween Eye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initial Platform</strong>: Steam (PC)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Script Length</strong>: Over 500,000 words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illustration Count</strong>: Over 300 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Languages: </strong>Simplified Chinese/Traditional Chinese/English/Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Acting</strong>: Fully English Dubbed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: Over 20 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/75000771c9582d6822b0c076fdfab591.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Over 500,000 words of immersive storytelling, with more than 15 unique endings.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/df9714cc0ccfc975164fa3a5984b14ca.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/272610b7d59bb8f4b61a7d081e6d7db2.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No instant-death choices. Every decision you make will meaningfully impact the story and the fate of its characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/838f64c9bc0966696332617f8a891b64.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>300+ full-color, hand-drawn CGs (no variants).</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve adopted a storyboard-style CG presentation, using dynamic compositions to fully bring out the atmosphere of each scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/cd099a465a538e8ac16120a274f851a3.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/4602e0feaec2f333e15e5d3a40aaecf6.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/31f14d25200ce8f425255ca1ec7794ce.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>100+ full-color, hand-drawn backgrounds (no variants).</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene was carefully crafted to match the story\u2019s tone, with details you can explore to better understand the characters and the world around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/4f9ebd1e898e1efc96584f37670ae4f4.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/b54a424755a44e6e1c7106020c6c8f66.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/2e024fe06576d34980a07501c9131e5b.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>100+ uniquely designed characters, each with their own personality and visual style.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even background characters \u2013those you might meet just once \u2013have been thoughtfully created to add depth and realism to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/7df416d0458749f62fd1e82a4e6599ce.avif?t=1755063165\" width=830 height=1227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A clean, intuitive UI with powerful features.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character, CG, and scene galleries are available in-game, so you can revisit your favorite moments at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/ede30bf31e645eeda37207fe648d3165.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/e954775f2f766789fa36ccb1f098eed4.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/e524ac1cb144410adf8288a312de8f45.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fully voiced in English, with support for four language modes.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To match the game\u2019s worldbuilding, the entire story is fully voiced in English and offers Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, and Japanese language options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>40+ original music tracks, crafted specifically for this world.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A music gallery is also available to help you collect and enjoy the full range of the game\u2019s emotional soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/1df3ed2f0cb68c6fd4a157d11b60b7b8.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/7ec59ea7e064250cff653f114be6c048.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/0020395ff61ea8e81c050543db717fea.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: Due to technical reasons, some localized content has not yet been UI-adapted. We will fix this in the official version.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/41015e1d55f48f4bc5a0d3ae30a4b112.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/e9c44cbfa7b8c6c3eddd6399e438a239.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span>Grey is an ordinary young man living in a rural town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the invitation of a fellow townsman, he traveled to the capital, Rivera, to participate in a months-long study exchange program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, on his very first night in Rivera, he had a strange dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dream, a group of people wearing eerie masks seemed to be plotting an assassination attempt on the king...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 The next day, news broke that the king was indeed attacked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should Grey use the information he had to help those who were innocently harmed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or should he stay out of trouble and keep his distance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly\u2014was what he saw that night truly just a dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/311a3575260de56d75721a4c613a81b0.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the fictional country of Merya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an era of booming industrial development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity is widespread, factory assembly lines roar around the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock codes scroll ceaselessly on towering billboards, and city center streets are packed with cars...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet no one notices that the glass-clad skyscrapers cast shadows large enough to engulf the entire city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/bf45fbd622ba1841fc8ac07e153a58cb.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/f389eb28ec24940174b3f8b977f4b135.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/00e3bf76ddfcdc6eb6c920fad18c8cd8.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/b0335e4cd064c653eefc82725ca3d33d.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=1600 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/fec024fb5e5fdce526e4af97ee1eae61.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Title</strong>: Halloween Eye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initial Platform</strong>: Steam (PC)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Script Length</strong>: Over 500,000 words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illustration Count</strong>: Over 300 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Languages: </strong>Simplified Chinese/Traditional Chinese/English/Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Acting</strong>: Fully English Dubbed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: Over 20 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/75000771c9582d6822b0c076fdfab591.avif?t=1755063165\" data-has-big width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Over 500,000 words of immersive storytelling, with more than 15 unique endings.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/df9714cc0ccfc975164fa3a5984b14ca.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/272610b7d59bb8f4b61a7d081e6d7db2.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No instant-death choices. Every decision you make will meaningfully impact the story and the fate of its characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/838f64c9bc0966696332617f8a891b64.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>300+ full-color, hand-drawn CGs (no variants).</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve adopted a storyboard-style CG presentation, using dynamic compositions to fully bring out the atmosphere of each scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/cd099a465a538e8ac16120a274f851a3.avif?t=1755063165\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ct